CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiFirst::
    .string "ERIKA trains Bug-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "The left side is FIELD RESEARCH.\n"
    .string "The right side is LAB RESEARCH.\p"
    .string "Either route reaches ERIKA. You can\n"
    .string "battle the researchers or use each\l"
    .string "side's observation exercise.\p"
    .string "The plants are here because this place\n"
    .string "is a habitat.\p"
    .string "FIRE, FLYING, and ROCK attacks work\n"
    .string "well against Bug.\p"
    .string "But don't assume every Bug POKéMON\n"
    .string "fights the same way. They adapt.\p"
    .string "BUTTERFREE has been with me a long\n"
    .string "time. Want it to show you what I mean?$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiYes::
    .string "Good.\p"
    .string "Don't just think about damage.\n"
    .string "Watch what happens to the battle itself.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiBattleDefeatEmpty::
    .string "$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiWin::
    .string "There you go.\p"
    .string "BUTTERFREE isn't built to overpower\n"
    .string "everything. It changes the fight until\l"
    .string "the fight favors it.\p"
    .string "That's worth remembering with ERIKA.\p"
    .string "FIRE, FLYING, and ROCK hit Bug hard.\n"
    .string "But knowing a weakness isn't enough if\l"
    .string "her POKéMON change the situation first.\p"
    .string "Adapt with them.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiLoss::
    .string "One small change can turn the whole\n"
    .string "battle.\p"
    .string "Don't keep doing something just because\n"
    .string "it worked a minute ago.\p"
    .string "Try me again when you're ready.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetry::
    .string "Want another try?$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryYes::
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "Show me how you adapt.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRetryNo::
    .string "Fair enough.\n"
    .string "I'll be here.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiDecline::
    .string "Fair enough.\p"
    .string "Remember: FIRE. FLYING. ROCK.\p"
    .string "And if ERIKA changes the battle on\n"
    .string "you... change your plan too.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRepeat::
    .string "Short version?\p"
    .string "FIRE. FLYING. ROCK.\n"
    .string "Watch for status.\p"
    .string "And don't get attached to one plan.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiAfterPracticed::
    .string "Nice work.\p"
    .string "ERIKA changed the battle on you.\n"
    .string "You changed with it.\p"
    .string "That's what the COCOON BADGE is about.\p"
    .string "And TM26 is SIGNAL BEAM.\n"
    .string "Even a good attack can confuse the\l"
    .string "situation. Keep adapting.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiAfterSkipped::
    .string "You skipped BUTTERFREE and still beat\n"
    .string "ERIKA?\p"
    .string "Then you learned the lesson without my\n"
    .string "demonstration. Good.\p"
    .string "That COCOON BADGE suits you.\n"
    .string "TM26 is SIGNAL BEAM.\p"
    .string "Whatever happens next, don't let one\n"
    .string "good plan become your only plan.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchOffer::
    .string "You've come a long way since BUTTERFREE\n"
    .string "first showed you how a battle can change.\p"
    .string "Want to see how much my team has\n"
    .string "changed too?$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchStart::
    .string "Good.\n"
    .string "Then adapt with me.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchDefeat::
    .string "You kept changing with the battle.\n"
    .string "That's exactly what I wanted to see.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchAfter::
    .string "BUTTERFREE's still my partner.\p"
    .string "The team around it changed, but the\n"
    .string "lesson didn't.\p"
    .string "A good plan matters.\n"
    .string "Knowing when to change it matters more.$"

CeladonCity_Gym_Text_SatoshiRematchDecline::
    .string "Fair enough.\n"
    .string "Come back when you want another lesson\l"
    .string "in adaptation.$"
